  "SourceRange": {
    "direct": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "集对应的原文素材范围，可以沿整本源文的文件顺序跨文件（ADR 0097）。\n\n起点是 ``source_file`` 里的 ``start``，终点是 ``end_file`` 里的 ``end``（不含）；``end_file`` 缺省时与\n``source_file`` 相同。偏移量落在 ``normalize_source_text`` 的归一化坐标系内（narration 为精确切分点，\ndrama 为软素材范围），是各自文件内的下标。路径是项目根相对 POSIX 路径（如 ``source/novel.txt``）。\n两个文件之间的先后由整本源文清单决定，这里不校验。",
      "properties": {
        "source_file": {
          "title": "Source File",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "start": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Start",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "end": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "End",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "end_file": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "End File"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source_file",
        "start",
        "end"
      ],
      "title": "SourceRange",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "model_facing": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "source_file": {
          "title": "Source File",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "start": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Start",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "end": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "End",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "end_file": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "End File"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source_file",
        "start",
        "end"
      ],
      "title": "SourceRange",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
